<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Dreamin</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">PARTYNEXTDOOR</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Dreamin</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">35sZOqVnTQNIGWGURrFdLh</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.320" end="00:17.820">Yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.330" end="00:18.830">Rick James, bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.680" end="00:20.780">Party like I'm Rick James, bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.780" end="00:22.700">Ride around, gettin' it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.700" end="00:24.700">Blowin' money on my main bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.700" end="00:27.060">Uh, bumpin' 2 Chainz, bumpin' 2 Chainz (whoo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.060" end="00:29.230">In the Range Rove' (whoo), ain't a damn thing (ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.230" end="00:31.260">Ain't a fluke, baby (ah), ain't a fluke, baby (ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.260" end="00:33.820">Cause the hook game got me out the loot (whoo), baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.820" end="00:35.320">And I'm out of here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.260" end="00:37.250">Racks on racks, I'm a lot to serve (serve up)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.250" end="00:39.280">So fucked up, she gots to stare up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.280" end="00:42.370">But she don't hear what she don't wanna hear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.370" end="00:45.660">Leanin', outside I've been leanin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.660" end="00:47.670">50 side of me's dreamin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.670" end="00:50.760">Other of side me schemin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.760" end="00:54.420">Vibe with me, slide with me, get high with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.420" end="00:58.710">Ridin' so clean, all night, I've been</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.710" end="01:02.750">Vibin', slidin', gettin' high, ridin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.750" end="01:08.940">So clean, all night, I've been, I've been</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.940" end="01:14.180">I've been waiting for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.180" end="01:20.060">To get high, get high, get high with me, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.060" end="01:22.490">Ooh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.490" end="01:26.620">I must be dreamin' (dreamin', oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.620" end="01:30.980">I must be dreamin' (dreamin'), oh-whoa</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.980" end="01:34.830">I must be dreamin' (dreamin')</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.830" end="01:39.780">I must be dreamin' (dreamin', oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.780" end="01:43.150">Get high, get high, get high, get high</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.150" end="01:48.230">Get high, get high, get high</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.230" end="01:51.670">I must be dreamin' (when I'm dreamin', oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.670" end="01:56.070">I must be (must be) dreamin' (when I'm dreamin', oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.070" end="01:58.150">They don't hear me, like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.150" end="01:59.860">See my money in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.860" end="02:01.860">Y'all must not hear me, like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.860" end="02:04.450">So, I can get inside of you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.450" end="02:06.060">They don't hear me, like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.060" end="02:08.420">I've already seen inside of you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.420" end="02:11.300">Better hear me right, sorry now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.300" end="02:12.800">Better hear me twice, sorry now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.640" end="02:14.140">I'm dreamin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.850" end="02:17.850" /></div></body></tt>